{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cPile up the leaves, then pile up your cash\u2026\u201d</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/ae42e164d5fe790d0762e0e85f0e1ce0.avif?t=1773943259\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras_big/ae42e164d5fe790d0762e0e85f0e1ce0.avif?t=1773943259 width=800 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the full story of Leaf Blower Co., clear away clutter and bring back a world of peace and tranquillity. And of course, no-one expects you to do all of this for free! Spend your hard-earned cash on new gear, upgrades, and even new styles. It\u2019s important to have the right tool for the job, and if you don\u2019t do it, who else is gonna skin your bin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/2e3a8276faa1e4ff86e43f5027168193.poster.avif?t=1773943259\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/2e3a8276faa1e4ff86e43f5027168193.webm?t=1773943259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/2e3a8276faa1e4ff86e43f5027168193.mp4?t=1773943259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/c77f43d53898130a9845b2bfcccc5dee.avif?t=1773943259\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras_big/c77f43d53898130a9845b2bfcccc5dee.avif?t=1773943259 width=800 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaf blowing is not all just sunshine and rainbows - after all, the school playground still needs those leaves gone even if it is pouring with rain; a sudden snow storm at the tennis court is just an excuse for you to really put your leaf blower through its paces; and while it\u2019s a bit unusual that the Mayor needs a last minute clean up of his garden after sunset, who are you to say no?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/25346eddf87ddb2c7112cdf139e3fc24.poster.avif?t=1773943259\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/25346eddf87ddb2c7112cdf139e3fc24.webm?t=1773943259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/25346eddf87ddb2c7112cdf139e3fc24.mp4?t=1773943259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/cd8ec69fa5aad69b0271bf1c56cc2f34.avif?t=1773943259\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras_big/cd8ec69fa5aad69b0271bf1c56cc2f34.avif?t=1773943259 width=800 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the true satisfaction of restoring peace and tranquility after a job well done; get in the zone as you blow away anything out of place; and lose yourself as you wander through a host of warm and welcoming locales.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/dcced6463801d0f8859f667082e4ebc7.poster.avif?t=1773943259\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/dcced6463801d0f8859f667082e4ebc7.webm?t=1773943259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/dcced6463801d0f8859f667082e4ebc7.mp4?t=1773943259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/63820600e9cd77e4bb4af9d96f24bbbb.avif?t=1773943259\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras_big/63820600e9cd77e4bb4af9d96f24bbbb.avif?t=1773943259 width=800 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location has a selection of optional bonus objectives and hidden easter eggs throughout to reward exploration of every nook and cranny. It\u2019ll take a keen eye and knowledge of all the tools at your disposal to find them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/118ab177c62a00b10c155d8113e275f1.poster.avif?t=1773943259\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/118ab177c62a00b10c155d8113e275f1.webm?t=1773943259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/118ab177c62a00b10c155d8113e275f1.mp4?t=1773943259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras/be2cef8921daae8a3dcf752d307dc07e.avif?t=1773943259\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571710/extras_big/be2cef8921daae8a3dcf752d307dc07e.avif?t=1773943259 width=800 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you\u2019ve finished the Campaign, look no further than Free Play mode to satisfy that Leaf Blowing itch. With the ability to choose whatever location takes your fancy, your perfect weather conditions, and your ideal time of day, the choice is completely up to you. From a snowy morning on the beach to a glorious sunset in the park, and everything in between, play Leaf Blower Co. your way!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"And So It Begins...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3571710/b7fdde2090a36e19d28e6cca301dfdb875da8b5d.jpg"},{"name":"New Toys","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3571710/281194bc7f334fbd364a2a6b86b7e5a9fca8bcb9.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Outfitted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3571710/47b65a916c88c718a52d7400ab61a49ef538487e.jpg"},{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3571710/c5f815059737eeec0c37545ead5359d84875f986.jpg"},{"name":"Job Done!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3571710/303bae0cdcec9949f0cf21fa3ffb99b6c764f018.jpg"},{"name":"All Skilled Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3571710/579ab1ba21b7c823be7817abb3267cd10e583331.jpg"},{"name":"The Professional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3571710/4fe03d1ed409fa6b4225a45826875cc18c7fdd15.jpg"},{"name":"Doing A Little Extra","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3571710/01d1dbd625a4ad9ac135f4bcbb66f8f158abc307.jpg"},{"name":"Turn Up The Heat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3571710/7dbb704721560b13acf6c71e786a9bf1f79b2658.jpg"},{"name":"Now We're Talkin'","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea